The legal text is the Cayman Islands Constitution Order 2009 (SI 2009 No. 1379) as published on the Cayman Islands Government legislation site, https://legislation.gov.ky, retrieved 29 October 2026 (original version as made; the PDF is a copy of the text published on legislation.gov.uk). The PDF carries no licence statement; the source is credited here.

Changes made by Lexifina: the text layer of the PDF was converted to one Markdown file per section, one subsection or item per line; spacing and quotation marks were normalised; page headers, footnotes and the signature were left out; section headings were taken from the Order's own contents list. The wording of the law was not changed.

Lexifina's own contributions (the arrangement of the history, the commit messages, the tables and the
tools) are dedicated to the public domain under CC0 1.0 Universal: https://creativecommons.org/publicdomain/zero/1.0/
